\newlabel{fig:scheme_18c}{{2}{4}{Experimental level scheme of \iso {18}{C} compared with shell-model calculations using the WBT interaction, the three-body model of \cite {yakhelef2010} that predicts the astrophysical $1^-$ state, and \textit {ab initio} coupled-cluster effective interactions (CCEI) \cite {jansen2014}.\relax }{figure.caption.3}{}}
